# The Capacitor trees `cap sync` regenerates (#87). Capacitor's own
# `apps/mobile/android/.gitignore` already keeps all three out of the
# repository — but Prettier reads only the ROOT `.gitignore`, not a nested one,
# so `format:check` reports the copied web bundle's own minified CSS and JS as
# badly formatted on any machine where a sync has run. That is a local-only red
# with no fix a contributor can apply, which is the shape that teaches people to
# stop running the gate. `scripts/check-repo-rules.sh` prunes the same three
# paths, for the same reason -- three of them, not five: the two JSON files below
# carry no source header, so only Prettier ever looked at them.
apps/mobile/android/app/src/main/assets/public/
apps/mobile/android/app/src/main/assets/capacitor.config.json
apps/mobile/android/app/src/main/assets/capacitor.plugins.json
apps/mobile/android/app/src/main/res/xml/config.xml
apps/mobile/android/capacitor-cordova-android-plugins/
